@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor Black

title Diagrama de Sequência - Transferência de Propriedade

actor "Vendedor" as Seller
actor "Comprador" as Buyer
participant "Frontend" as FE
participant "BFF Gateway" as BFF
participant "Orchestrator" as Orch
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
queue "RabbitMQ" as MQ
participant "Queue Worker" as QW
participant "Offchain Consumer" as OC
participant "Blockchain (Besu)" as BC
participant "Event Listener" as EL

Buyer -> FE: Seleciona propriedade para comprar
FE -> BFF: POST /api/transfers/request\n{matriculaId, buyerCpf}
BFF -> Orch: POST /transfers/request + JWT

Orch -> Orch: Validar propriedade (status OK)
Orch -> DB: Verificar transferência ativa
DB --> Orch: Nenhuma transferência ativa

Orch -> DB: Buscar buyer por CPF
DB --> Orch: Buyer data {id, walletAddress}

Orch -> DB: INSERT transfer\nstatus = PENDENTE
DB --> Orch: Transfer ID created

Orch -> MQ: Publish CONFIGURE_TRANSFER job\n{transferId, seller, buyer, matricula, approvers[]}
Orch -> DB: UPDATE status = CONFIGURANDO
Orch --> BFF: 201 Created {transferId}
BFF --> FE: Transfer initiated
FE --> Buyer: Transferência iniciada

MQ --> QW: Consume CONFIGURE_TRANSFER job
QW -> OC: POST /api/transfers/request\n{from, to, matricula}

OC -> OC: Build transaction
OC -> BC: requestPropertyTransfer(from, to, matricula)
BC --> OC: TX Hash: 0xdef...

BC -> BC: Mine transaction
BC -> BC: Create pending transfer struct\nCalculate requestHash
BC -> BC: Emit TransferRequested\n{requestHash, matricula, from, to, requester}

BC --> EL: Event detected
EL -> EL: Extract event.args[0] = requestHash\nExtract event.transactionHash
EL -> Orch: POST /webhooks/.../transfer-requested\n{transferHash, matriculaId, from, to, txHash}
Orch -> DB: UPDATE transfer\nrequest_hash, blockchain_tx_hash\nstatus = AGUARDANDO_APROVACOES
Orch --> EL: 200 OK

== Fase de Aprovações (3 instituições) ==

Seller -> FE: Instituição Financeira aprova
FE -> BFF: POST /api/transfers/{id}/approve
BFF -> Orch: POST /transfers/{id}/approve\n{approverId}
Orch -> MQ: Publish APPROVE_TRANSFER job\n{transferId, approver: FINANCIAL}
MQ --> QW: Consume job
QW -> OC: POST /api/transfers/approve\n{requestHash, institution: FINANCIAL}
OC -> BC: approveTransferAsFinancial(requestHash)
BC -> BC: pendingTransfers[requestHash]\n.financialApproved = true
BC -> BC: Emit TransferApproved\n{requestHash, "FINANCIAL", approverAddress}
BC --> EL: Event detected
EL -> Orch: POST /webhooks/.../transfer-approved\n{requestHash, institution, approver}
Orch -> DB: Record approval 1/3
Orch --> EL: 200 OK

note over BC: Cartório aprova (2/3)

Seller -> FE: Cartório aprova
FE -> BFF: POST /api/transfers/{id}/approve
BFF -> Orch: POST /transfers/{id}/approve
Orch -> MQ: Publish APPROVE_TRANSFER job
MQ --> QW: Consume
QW -> OC: POST /api/transfers/approve\n{requestHash, institution: REGISTRY_OFFICE}
OC -> BC: approveTransferAsRegistryOffice(requestHash)
BC -> BC: pendingTransfers[requestHash]\n.registryOfficeApproved = true
BC -> BC: Emit TransferApproved
BC --> EL: Event detected
EL -> Orch: POST /webhooks/.../transfer-approved
Orch -> DB: Record approval 2/3

note over BC: Prefeitura aprova (3/3)

Seller -> FE: Prefeitura aprova
FE -> BFF: POST /api/transfers/{id}/approve
BFF -> Orch: POST /transfers/{id}/approve
Orch -> MQ: Publish APPROVE_TRANSFER job
MQ --> QW: Consume
QW -> OC: POST /api/transfers/approve\n{requestHash, institution: MUNICIPALITY}
OC -> BC: approveTransferAsMunicipality(requestHash)
BC -> BC: pendingTransfers[requestHash]\n.municipalityApproved = true
BC -> BC: Emit TransferApproved
BC --> EL: Event detected
EL -> Orch: POST /webhooks/.../transfer-approved
Orch -> DB: Record approval 3/3

== Aceitação do Comprador ==

Buyer -> FE: Aceita a transferência
FE -> BFF: POST /api/transfers/{id}/accept
BFF -> Orch: POST /transfers/{id}/accept\n{buyerId}
Orch -> Orch: Validar buyer é o correto
Orch -> MQ: Publish ACCEPT_TRANSFER job
MQ --> QW: Consume
QW -> OC: POST /api/transfers/accept\n{requestHash, buyerAddress}
OC -> BC: buyerAcceptsTransfer(requestHash)

BC -> BC: Check: all 3 approvals + buyer acceptance?
BC -> BC: **Auto-execute transfer!**\nTransfer tokens: seller → buyer\nUpdate propertyOwner[matricula]
BC -> BC: pendingTransfers[requestHash].executed = true
BC -> BC: Emit TransferExecuted\n{requestHash, matricula, from, to}

BC --> EL: Event detected
EL -> Orch: POST /webhooks/.../transfer-executed\n{requestHash, matriculaId, from, to, txHash}
Orch -> DB: UPDATE property\nproprietario = buyer.id\nstatus = OK
Orch -> DB: UPDATE transfer\nstatus = CONCLUIDA
Orch --> EL: 200 OK

note over FE: Frontend polling ou WebSocket

FE -> BFF: GET /api/transfers/{id}
BFF -> Orch: GET /transfers/{id}
Orch -> DB: SELECT transfer
DB --> Orch: {status: CONCLUIDA, ...}
Orch --> BFF: Transfer completed
BFF --> FE: Transfer data
FE --> Buyer: Transferência concluída! ✅
FE --> Seller: Propriedade transferida

@enduml
